/Title (Modelling\040the\040persistence\040of\040conditional\040variances)
/Author (F\040Engle\040Robert\054\040Bollerslev\040Tim)
/Subject (This\040paper\040will\040discuss\040the\040current\040research\040in\040building\040models\040of\040conditional\040variances\040using\040the\040Autoregressive\040Conditional\040Heteroskedastic\040\050ARCH\051\040and\040Generalized\040ARCH\040\050GARCH\051\040formulations\056\040The\040discussion\040will\040be\040motivated\040by\040a\040simple\040asset\040pricing\040theory\040which\040is\040particularly\040appropriate\040for\040examining\040futures\040contracts\040with\040risk\040averse\040agents\056\040A\040new\040class\040of\040models\040defined\040to\040be\040integrated\040in\040variance\040is\040then\040introduced\056\040This\040new\040class\040of\040models\040includes\040the\040variance\040analogue\040of\040a\040unit\040root\040in\040the\040mean\040as\040a\040special\040case\056\040The\040models\040are\040argued\040to\040be\040both\040theoretically\040important\040for\040the\040asset\040pricing\040models\040and\040empirically\040relevant\056\040The\040conditional\040density\040is\040then\040generalized\040from\040a\040normal\040to\040a\040Student\055t\040with\040unknown\040degrees\040of\040freedom\056\040By\040estimating\040the\040degrees\040of\040freedom\054\040implications\040about\040the\040conditional\040kurtosis\040of\040these\040models\040and\040time\040aggregated\040models\040can\040be\040drawn\056\040A\040further\040generalization\040allows\040the\040conditional\040variance\040to\040be\040a\040non\055linear\040function\040of\040the\040squared\040innovations\056\040Throughout\040empirical\056\056\056)
/Keywords (01\040Jan\0401986\054\040Econometric\040Reviews\054\040Conditional\040variance\054\040Autoregressive\040conditional\040heteroskedasticity\054\040Conditional\040probability\040distribution\054\040Heteroscedasticity\054\040Variance\040\050accounting\051\054\040University\040of\040California\054\040San\040Diego\054\040Northwestern\040University)
